{"version":1,"content":"<p>44歲美國女星安妮希芙威（Anne Hathaway）為美國電影監製丈夫Adam Shulman誕下第3胎，周二（17日）被拍到於美國紐約與BB外出，安妮戴住鴨舌帽與黑超，穿着灰色長身外套，以前向式嬰兒背帶將BB綁在胸前。</p><p>安妮與同行的友人一</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T02:44:33.056495+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T01:45:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T02:37:36.316299+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T02:37:36.316299+00:00","content_hash":"6f12aee8ad5dfb2a337100d4195882a84099b7ca7fe1b565805249bd8ff0f59b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}